    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d489">

                <pb facs="0647" n="535" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg535"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 882.51/817A</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Liberia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Bundy</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-08-12T18:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 12, 1918, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department still endeavoring to arrange financial assistance for Liberia.</p>
                <p>Cable what, if any, aid Liberia has lately received from Bank British West
                    Africa.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
